<title>USA: Motorola Inc Q1 net, revenues lower.</title>
<headline>Motorola Inc Q1 net, revenues lower.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.53		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net			325,000		  384,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,642,000		6,955,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     610,800		  608,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Motorola said Q1 1997 results include the favorable settlement of certain patent claims, as well as a gain on the sale of an investment, although these items accounted for less than 10 percent of the pre-tax profits.</p>
<p>Motorola said Q1 1997 net margin on sales was 4.9 percent versus 5.5 percent in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Primary earnings per share were the same as fully diluted for Q1 1997 and Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
